{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Re-hydration that reconciles stored rows into the live "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntityStore"},{"type":"text","text":"s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without dropping unflushed writes or in-progress edits (rule #8)."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rehydrate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"store","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Store","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"policy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MergePolicy","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"store","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The live store to reconcile.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"policy","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Narrows the configured policy for this call only. Pass","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemoteAdditive"},{"text":" after a container rebuild,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"where a row’s absence says nothing about whether it was deleted.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Takes the store rather than ","type":"text"},{"code":"inout State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on purpose. Re-hydration is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"mid-session operation with two ","type":"text"},{"code":"await","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s in it (the flush, then the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fetches), and any caller holding a state snapshot across those would","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"overwrite everything dispatched in between. Here the flush and every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fetch complete first; only then does one suspension-free step pack a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fresh snapshot, merge, and unpack.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Under the default ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemote"},{"text":", remote edits and remote","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deletions surface mid-session. An ID is exempt whenever the local side","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"still has something to say about it — a drained-but-unflushed write, an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"un-drained edit, a pending deletion, or a write whose save failed. Those","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"always win, and that guarantee is not configurable.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pending writes and deletions are flushed to disk ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"before","type":"text"}]},{"text":" the merge, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remote-change refresh that fires during the debounce window can’t read a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stale disk row for an entity the user just edited or deleted and resurrect","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it. The flush closes most of the window; the dirty set closes what the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"remaining suspension points let through.","type":"text"}]},{"style":"important","name":"Important","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"One case can’t be inferred — an edit still sitting in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view’s local ","type":"text"},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has never reached the store, so a remote value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can land underneath it. Bindings made with ","type":"text"},{"code":"store.binding(_:sending:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dispatch on write and are covered already. Otherwise declare the edit","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/editing","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" (see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), which exempts one ID for as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"long as it is being edited, or register a whole collection with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferInMemory","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If a fetch fails, the corresponding ","type":"text"},{"code":"EntityStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is left untouched","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and the failure is reported via ","type":"text"},{"code":"onFailure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"rehydrate(into:policy:)","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"State","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"code":"SwiduxObservable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"extendedModule":"SwiduxPersistence","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rehydrate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC","text":"Store","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Action","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"policy","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV","text":"MergePolicy","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}],"externalID":"s:17SwiduxPersistence0B11CoordinatorCAA0A00A10ObservableRzrlE9rehydrate4into6policyyAD5StoreCyxq_G_AA11MergePolicyVSgtYaF","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPersistence"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencecoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/EditingHolds":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/editingholds","role":"symbol","title":"EditingHolds","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EditingHolds","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"IDs an app has declared it is editing, exempt from a re-hydration merge for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as long as the hold is in force.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EditingHolds","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/EntityDB":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EntityDB","fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EntityDB"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/entitydb","title":"EntityDB","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EntityDB"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A generic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@ModelActor"},{"type":"text","text":" that reads and writes any "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistableModel"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","title":"SwiduxPersistence","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/MergePolicy/preferInMemory":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/mergepolicy\/preferinmemory","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","